data: {"id": "22fac193bc2049b4-thinking-parallel_evidence-1777", "run_id": "22fac193bc2049b4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 本轮已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期状态（YAML & Describe）：**\n   - `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-07T23:09:46Z`，距今约 38 分钟，且 `phase: Running`（Kubernetes API 对象仍存在，未从 etcd 中移除）。\n   - **关键阻碍：`metadata.finalizers: [aiops.lab/hold]`** — 这是一个自定义 finalizer，kubelet 和控制器无法在 finalizer 未完成清理前删除该 Pod 对象。\n   - `deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 0`，`terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 10`。\n   - 容器 `app` 状态：`Terminated`，Exit Code 137（SIGKILL），StartTime 23:09:43，Finished 23:09:57，Restart Count = 0。\n   - Node 信息：`nodeName: node2`。\n\n2. **事", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788824924895, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

